
---

### 🛡️ `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Node modules (if using npm for enhancements)
node_modules/

# OS-specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE/editor folders
.vscode/
.idea/

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/

# Logs
*.log

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Optional: ignore compiled CSS/JS if using preprocessors
*.min.css
*.min.js


